A one-key '''self cube''': hold the alt-cast modifier and cast [[The Cube]] on yourself in a single press. Paste into your autoexec / console (rebind <code>e</code> to any key you like):

<pre>
alias +quickcube " +in_alt_cast_modifier; +in_ability2;"
alias -quickcube " -in_alt_cast_modifier; -in_ability2;"
bind e "+quickcube"
</pre>

